    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      55.15,
      470.39,
      298.2,
      529.73
    ],
    "text": "I, Kuragamage Don Lal Kantha, Minister of Agriculture, Livestock, Lands and Irrigation do hereby declare, under Sub-section (1) of Section 5 of the Land Acquisition Act, that the lands described below are required for a public purpose and will be acquired under the provisions of that Act.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      55.15,
      540.39,
      298.21,
      623.73
    ],
    "text": "The allotments of land depicted in the Advance Tracing No. Ya/KRN/2016/152 dated 30.11.2020, prepared by the Surveyor General, situated in the Village called Kovalam in the Grama Niladhari Division No. J/41 Karainagar North West in the Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division of Karainagar in the District of Jaffna, Northern Province and bounded as follows:",
